{'symbol': 'CZR', 'date': '2019-11-27 23:30:00', 'title': 'CAESARS ANNOUNCES EXPIRATION OF CONSENT SOLICITATION, RECEIPT OF REQUISITE CONSENTS ON 5% NOTES DUE 2024', 'text': 'CAESARS ENTERTAINMENT CORPORATION ANNOUNCES EXPIRATION OF CONSENT SOLICITATION AND RECEIPT OF REQUISITE CONSENTS WITH RESPECT TO ITS 5.00% CONVERTIBLE SENIOR NOTES DUE 2024.CONSENT SOLICITATION ON PROPOSED AMENDMENTS TO INDENTURE DATED OCT 6 2017 GOVERNING 5% NOTES DUE 2024 EXPIRED 5 PM NY CITY TIME NOV 27.AS OF EXPIRATION TIME, CO RECEIVED VALID CONSENTS IN RESPECT OF AT LEAST A MAJORITY OF AGGREGATE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT OF ALL OUTSTANDING NOTES.'}